From 87d5a3254556c7fae58cc8d02e2b893f75fbdfb0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 17:16:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add AspClean2026 deconvolver and integrate into Synthesis
 pipeline

### Motivation

- Introduce a new Asp-based deconvolution algorithm `asp2026` (AspClean2026) to provide an alternative adaptive residual-based component optimizer for minor-cycle cleaning.
- Expose the new algorithm to the CLI/UI and the synthesis deconvolver factory so it can be selected as a `deconvolver` option.
- Update base interfaces to support the different update/scale paths required by the new algorithm.

### Description

- Add new measurement-equation implementation `AspClean2026` with header `AspClean2026.h` and implementation `AspClean2026.cc`, implementing a tanh-mapped residual component, LBFGS optimization callbacks, convolution, objective evaluation, and control flags (`useLegacyStrengthLogic`, `useHogbomFallback`, `useLegacyScaleImagePath`).
- Add new adapter `SDAlgorithmAspClean2026` with header `SDAlgorithmAspClean2026.h` and implementation `SDAlgorithmAspClean2026.cc` to wrap `AspClean2026` for use in the synthesis deconvolution framework and to wire initialization, one-step execution, and finalization.
- Integrate the new algorithm into the deconvolver selection by including `SDAlgorithmAspClean2026.h` in `SynthesisDeconvolver.h` and adding the `asp2026` branch in `SynthesisDeconvolver.cc` to instantiate `SDAlgorithmAspClean2026` (selecting single/MFS mode via `decpars.specmode`).
- Update `AspMatrixCleaner.h` to adjust `updateModelAndResidual` signature to accept `scale` and `scaleXfr` arguments and declare virtuals `useLegacyStrengthLogic`, `useHogbomFallback`, and `useLegacyScaleImagePath` to allow algorithm-specific behavior.
- Update UI plumbing in `hummbee_cl_interface.cc` to expose `asp2026` as a valid `deconvolver` option and add corresponding watchpoint entries so the UI can surface relevant parameters.
- Minor type/const adjustments and helper changes in `AspClean2026.cc` (e.g. non-const cleaner context, transform bounds typed as `double`, and small API adaptations to fit the existing AspMatrixCleaner infrastructure).

### Testing

- Project build: ran a full debug build of the synthesis target (`make`), and the build completed successfully.
- Synthesis unit tests: executed the synthesis/imager unit test suite that covers deconvolver selection and minor-cycle execution, and the tests completed with all relevant tests passing for the modified components.
- No regressions reported in existing Asp/Multi-scale testcases that exercise deconvolver selection and minor-cycle behavior.
